{"code":"104540","name":"코렌텍","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리장비와용품","sector_desc":"의료기기·진단기기·의료용품. 수출 비중이 높고 인허가와 해외 판매 성과가 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2000년 국내 최초 인공관절 전문 제조기업으로 설립되어 2013년 코스닥에 상장함. 미국 현지법인 Corentec America로 해외 마케팅을 강화하고, 종속회사 선헬스케어인터내셔널을 통해 건강검진 서비스 및 ASC 병원을 운영하고 있음. 인공고관절, 인공슬관절이 매출의 85% 이상을 차지하며, 척추고정기기, 견관절, 족관절로 라인업을 확장하여 인공관절 토탈 솔루션을 제공함.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":5130.0,"open":5030.0,"high":5200.0,"low":4905.0,"volume":64087,"amount":328766310.0,"ret_1d":1.9881,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":5.7505,"ret_5":-8.3929,"ret_20":28.25,"ret_60":23.3173,"ret_120":-15.0662,"ret_250":-3.7523,"ma20":5126.25,"ma60":4405.75,"ma120":4434.6667,"ma200":5157.9,"close_vs_ma200":-0.5409,"close_vs_ma60":16.4387,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":281.8916,"r2_60":0.5157,"slope_120":-7.4715,"r2_120":0.0069,"slope_250":-36.1257,"r2_250":0.4502,"high52":7440.0,"low52":3385.0,"pos_52w":43.0333,"dd_52w":-31.0484,"mdd_1y":-48.0447,"atr14_pct":10.0529,"vol_ann_60":65.6604,"vol_avg20":264372.9,"vol_ratio20":0.2424,"vr5":0.6174,"vr20":8.4806,"amount_avg5":293697064.0,"amount_avg20":1304803453.0,"amount_avg60":476292592.4167,"obv_chg20":73.1589,"turnover_20":39.4368,"pv_eff_20":0.7163,"rsi14":53.5321,"frgn_net_5":7350.0,"inst_net_5":-6179.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0548,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0461,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0087,"frgn_net_20":-29262.0,"inst_net_20":-25839.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.2183,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.1927,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.411,"frgn_net_60":-24029.0,"inst_net_60":-25647.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1792,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.1913,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.3705,"frgn_net_120":-22821.0,"inst_net_120":-21474.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1702,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.1602,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.3304,"foreign_ratio":4.2,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.56,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":15.0,"op_margin_q":5.814,"op_qoq":66.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":7.1429,"rev_yoy":10.2564,"op_trend_4q":-37.3626,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.58,"debt_ratio":75.47,"per":10.22,"pbr